# Netlify redirects. Format:  /from  /to  [status]

# The site lives at kcscustomcomputers.com. Its netlify.app address used to
# serve a full second copy, which search engines treat as duplicate content;
# it forwards now. Forced (!) because every path there exists as a file, and an
# unforced rule loses to a file that exists. Deploy previews use other
# netlify.app hostnames and are unaffected.
https://kcscustomcomputers.netlify.app/*   https://kcscustomcomputers.com/:splat   301!

# Extensionless paths are already handled by Netlify's Pretty URLs, which also
# rewrote the site's own links. These entries keep the .html forms working for
# anything already bookmarked or linked, so nothing that ever pointed here 404s.
/index.html          /              301
/shop.html           /shop          301
/product.html        /product       301
/build-custom.html   /build-custom  301
/contact.html        /contact       301
# NOT /thanks.html — that is the contact form's POST target. A 301 on a POST
# is turned into a GET by the browser and the submitted fields are dropped,
# so a rule here would silently swallow every enquiry. Pretty URLs already
# serves /thanks; this path needs no rule and must not have one.

# The Privacy Policy and Terms pages show KC's policies exactly as Shopify
# publishes them at checkout (see policy.js for why). A browser cannot fetch
# those from this site — Shopify sends no CORS header — so Netlify fetches
# them on the server instead: a 200 here is a proxy, not a redirect.
# Deliberately narrow. It covers only the policies of KC's own store (shop
# 69199953974), so this site cannot be used to serve any other page from
# checkout.shopify.com under its own address.
/policy-src/69199953974/policies/*   https://checkout.shopify.com/69199953974/policies/:splat   200

# ---- KC's old Shopify storefront ---------------------------------------
#
# kcscustomcomputers.com was his Shopify store until it moved here; Shopify
# now runs on shop.kcscustomcomputers.com. Links to the old store live on in
# order emails, abandoned-cart emails, search results and bookmarks.

# Anything Shopify still has to handle goes to Shopify: carts, checkouts,
# customer accounts, and order-status pages (/<shop id>/orders/...).
# 302, not 301, deliberately: browsers keep a 301 forever, and a remembered
# redirect is exactly what sent KC's own browser the wrong way during the move.
/cart                    https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/cart                  302
/cart/*                  https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/cart/:splat           302
/checkout                https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/checkout              302
/checkouts/*             https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/checkouts/:splat      302
/account                 https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/account               302
/account/*               https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/account/:splat        302
/69199953974/*           https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/69199953974/:splat    302
/pages/data-sharing-opt-out   https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/pages/data-sharing-opt-out   302
# Refund and shipping policies are not published yet; if KC adds them they
# live on Shopify. Privacy and terms have pages here, mapped further down.
/policies/refund-policy       https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/policies/refund-policy       302
/policies/shipping-policy     https://shop.kcscustomcomputers.com/policies/shipping-policy     302

# Store pages that have an equivalent here: permanent, so rankings carry over.
# Products keep their Shopify handle; product.js looks a product up by handle
# as well as by this site's own id.
/collections/:c/products/:handle   /product?id=:handle   301
/products/:handle                  /product?id=:handle   301
/collections/*                     /shop                 301
/search                            /shop                 301
/pages/contact                     /contact              301
/policies/privacy-policy           /privacy              301
/policies/terms-of-service         /terms                301
/pages/*                           /                     301
